From 21cdb9d53d83c0be374d86fb89713bd7d9e424e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:46:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): quarantine refused receipts without stalling
 sibling tasks [daveey]

Keep strict append-only receipt certification; journal refused wire evidence and fence affected tasks and descendants locally. Publish safety holds before pagination can fail, preserve them across rebuild, and keep unrelated pull and push work moving. The prior per-board catch did not satisfy same-board isolation: real pull/sync regression is RED on main and GREEN with task-scoped quarantine. New safety regressions cover pickup, cache immutability, write failure, FIFO starvation, independent hold adoption and post-quarantine transport failure.
